{"abstract":"The rise of movement-based design (MBD) is fueled by the integration of computer technology into the movement of the everyday. Departing from traditional interface design, MBD prioritizes natural interaction, SportsHCI, and health promotion through physical activity. This paradigm shift has led to innovations in experimental applications and interaction techniques, including exergames, expressivity in interactions and soma-design. Various guidelines and frameworks have been proposed for specific purposes, from sports to virtual reality. This workshop explores participants' experiences and perspectives on MBD, delving into MBD workshop design and reflect on MBD methods and the current move towards MBD methodologies.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Van Rheden, Vincent","Reidsma, Dennis","Elbæk, Lars","Lallemand, Carine","Turmo Vidal, Laia","Matviienko, Andrii","Elvitigala, Don Samitha","Daiber, Florian","Zambetta, Fabio","Mueller, Florian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-755627"],"event":{"end":"2024-07-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-07-01","title":"2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Van Rheden, Vincent"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Germany","Luxembourg","Netherlands","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology","German Research Center for Artificial Intelligence (DFKI)","KTH Royal Institute of Technology","Monash University","RMIT University","University of Luxembourg","University of Salzburg","University of Twente"],"keyword":["Bodystorming","Embodiment","Interaction design","Methods","Movement based design"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"why movement based design exploring methods and experiences in mbd","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3658399","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-755627","identifier":[{"id":"85198905741","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-ecedb220-da67-4725-9654-a5dc93aaf49f"],"keyword":["Bodystorming","Embodiment","Interaction Design","Methods","Movement-Based Design"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-01B7F1148B0B678CA50BFF4BF4E5C245"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3658399","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/268445949/3656156.3658399.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"at","key":"university of salzburg","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Salzburg","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"university of twente","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Twente","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Research Unit of Psychology of Sport, Excellence and Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"lu","key":"university of luxembourg","loc":["Luxembourg","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Luxembourg","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"nl","key":"eindhove