{"abstract":"Life transitions, whether due to ageing, health conditions, or significant life events, pose unique challenges for individuals’ health and well-being. These periods demand adjustments in physical health and self-care of mental states. Meanwhile, interactive technologies like personal informatics, self-tracking tools, artificial intelligence (AI) driven health monitoring systems and virtual reality can enhance well-being by helping individuals understand their bodily changes; their role in life transitions is under-explored. Therefore, this workshop aims to bridge the gap between the availability of interactive technologies for managing health and well-being and their meaningful use during life transitions. By examining current practices and gaps, we seek to identify opportunities for designing interactive technologies and develop a research agenda to facilitate the alignment of these technologies with the evolving needs of individuals.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Karahanoğlu, Armağan","Vidal, Laia Turmo","Harrison, Daniel","Steane, Jamie","Ekhtiar, Tina","Almeida, Teresa","Vallgårda, Anna","Balaam, Madeline"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-789577"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Department of Informatics - Umeå University","KTH Royal Institute of Technology","Northumbria University","University of Twente"],"keyword":["Digital health","Health","Health data","Interactive technologies","Life transitions","Well being"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"life in transitions the role of technology in supporting well being in the heart of change","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-789577","ids":["itu-f23c8b0d-14f0-4224-b7e4-dd38061cbdc3"],"keyword":["Digital Health","Health","Health data","Interactive Technologies,","Life Transitions","well-being,"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-96B7D2BF1E8D5B82A0823D362CAAD6BC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"university of twente","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Twente","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"kth royal institute of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KTH Royal Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"northumbria university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Northumbria University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"department of informatics umeå university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Department of Informatics - Umeå University","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, IxD Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Armağan","key":"karahanoğlupau","last":"Karahanoğlu","name":"Karahanoğlu, Armağan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Laia Turmo","key":"vidalpau","last":"Vidal","name":"Vidal, Laia Turmo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Daniel","key":"harrisonpau","last":"Harrison","name":"Harrison, Daniel","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jamie","key":"steanepau","last":"Steane","name":"Steane, Jamie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tina","key":"ekhtiarpau","last":"Ekhtiar","name":"Ekhtiar, Tina","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Teresa","key":"almeidapau","last":"Almeida","name":"Almeida, Teresa","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna","key":"vallgårdapau","last":"Vallgårda","locid":"2fa5dc89-7d78-45d0-96c7-e8f39b78dd3e","name":"Vallgårda, Anna","orcid":"0000-0001-9898-8106","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Madeline","key":"balaampau","last":"Balaam","name":"Balaam, Madeline","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3677045.368547","eisbn":["9798400709654"],"pages":"1-5","status":"p","title":"NordiCHI '24 Adjunct: Adjunct Proceedings of the 2024 Nordic Conference on Human-Computer Interaction"},"review":"No Review","scoID":["2-s2.0-85206591205"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-f23c8b0d-14f0-4224-b7e4-dd38061cbdc3"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Life in Transitions: The Role of Technology in Supporting Well-being in the Heart of Change","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-789577","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"We share an emergent repository of nature-entangled methods-to-be shared, experimented with, and discussed during a conference workshop. We present them in-use, as they are in formation. We do not seek to theorise or even fully articulate these methods-to-be. Rather, to make them approachable and actionable for others by showing them not fully polished. By doing this, we advocate for increased transparency in the difficulties of creating new methods, techniques, tools, and approaches. Our contribution is threefold: we provide 1) an annotated portfolio of methods-to-be; 2) illustrative examples of how cross-pollination of these methods can enrich their situated use; and 3) a discussion of ways to further articulate the methods and deepen reflection on their roles in nature-entangled design processes.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Tomico, Oscar","Rosén, Anton Poikolainen","Keune, Svenja","Bertran, Ferran Altarriba","Wilde, Danielle","Galeote, Daniel Fernández","Lenskjold, Tau","Tikkanen, Ruut","Buruk, Oğuz 'Oz","Spors, Velvet"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-802098"],"event":{"end":"2024-07-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-07-01","title":"2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Tomico, Oscar"],"country":["Finland","Netherlands","Spain","Sweden"],"glorg":["Aalto University","All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology","Tampere University","Umeå University","University of Borås","University of Girona","University of Oulu"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"seeding a repository of methods to be for nature entangled design research","src":["sdu"],"sr