{"abstract":"Computing devices commonly act as tools, extending our abilities and shaping how we interact with the world. We investigate one such tool, the calculator, which helps with arithmetic, but also commonly offers specialized functions for conversions, formulas, or graphing. Through an analysis of calculator apps and use cases, we describe limitations of current calculators. Crucially, calculator apps remain detached from tasks, motivating us to explore how to more closely integrate calculation with the world through augmented reality (AR). AR calculators can directly use measurements and numbers from the world in calculations as well as display results of calculations in the world. We provide a conceptual account of calculation in AR, as well as video prototypes that concretize the concept across different scenarios. These examples demonstrate how moving tools like the calculator to AR offers tighter task integration and reduces the work required in translating between the world and computational tools.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Pohl, Henning","Hornbæk, Kasper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-735954"],"event":{"end":"2024-06-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-06-01","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Augmented reality","Concept","Mobile interaction","Tool use","Video prototyping","calculator"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"integrated calculators moving calculation into the world","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3643834.3661523","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-735954","identifier":[{"id":"85200407100","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-58291775-8c19-4636-8efa-e139eddca3fc"],"keyword":["augmented reality","calculator","concept","mobile interaction","tool use","video prototyping"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6D82CFA00A958417D6D2B30B2E35E86D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/753424620/Pohl2024DIS.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3643834.3661523","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Human-Centered Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henning","key":"pohlpau","last":"Pohl","locid":"4f6de337-0278-4daa-9d35-771a790c66a8","name":"Pohl, Henning","orcid":"0000-0002-1420-4309","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper","key":"hornbækpau","last":"Hornbæk","name":"Hornbæk, Kasper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anna","key":"vallgardapedh","last":"Vallgarda","name":"Vallgarda, Anna","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Li","key":"jonssonpedh","last":"Jonsson","name":"Jonsson, Li","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpedh","last":"Fritsch","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sarah Fdili","key":"alaouipedh","last":"Alaoui","name":"Alaoui, Sarah Fdili","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Christopher A.","key":"ledantecpedh","last":"Le Dantec","name":"Le Dantec, Christopher A.","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3643834.3661523","eisbn":["9798400705830"],"pages":"343-355","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"DIS '24: Proceedings of the 2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85200407100"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-58291775-8c19-4636-8efa-e139eddca3fc"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Integrated Calculators : Moving Calculation into the World","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-735954","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Individuals are increasingly interested in and responsible for assessing their own health. This study evaluates a fctional AI dermatologist for assistance in the self-assessment of moles. Building on the Signalling Theory, we tested the efect of textual descriptions provided by a virtual dermatologist, as manipulated across ‘Ability’, ‘Integrity,’ and ‘Benevolence’, along with the clinical assessment, ‘benign’ or ‘malignant’, afect users’ trust in the aforementioned trust pillars. Our study (N = 40) follows a 2 (Ability low/high) × 2 (Integrity low/high) × 2 (Benevolence low/high) × 2 (mole assessment benign/malignant) within-subject factorial design. Our results demonstrate that we can successfully infuence perceptions of ability and benevolence by manipulating the corresponding aspects of trust but not perceived integrity. Further, in the case of a malignant assessment, participants’ perception of trust increased across all aspects. Our results provide insights into the design of AI support systems for sensitive use cases, such as clinical self-assessments.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Als, Naja Kathrine Kollerup","Wester, Joel","Skov, Mikael B.","van Berkel, Niels"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-771128"],"event":{"end":"2024-07-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-07-01","title":"2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Signalling theory","Trust"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how can i signal you to trust me investigating ai trust signalling in clinical self assessments","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3643834.3661612","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-771128","identifier":[{"id":"85200372707","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d2a53070-4a8e-48b2-a6a0-ad8411615ff5"],"keyword":["AI Self-Assessment Tools","Human-AI Trust Building","Signalling theory","Trust"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DE216D02C0581CB4FDA08E44763AA179"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3643834.3661612","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/753239239/3643834.3661612.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Human-Centered Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Naja Kathrine","key":"kolleruppau","last":"Kollerup","locid":"df3c9179-c842-42c2-a1e5-ae30b03f72b2","name":"Als, Naja Kathrine Kollerup","name_org":"Kollerup, Naja Kathrine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Joel","key":"westerpau","last":"Wester","locid":"db375504-2a91-46a8-b60e-07e6cb8e267d","name":"Wester, Joel","orcid":"0000-0001-6332-9493","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mikael B.","key":"skovpau","last":"Skov","locid":"c82c4a8d-1612-4218-b5ab-35e729748eb8","name":"Skov, Mikael B.","orcid":"0000-0003-4488-5683","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"vanberkelpau","last":"van Berkel","locid":"4088b4e4-37e9-42fe-8cdc-43ae859a7cdb","name":"van Berkel, Niels","orcid":"0000-0001-5106-7692","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anna","key":"vallgårdapedh","last":"Vallgårda","name":"Vallgårda, Anna","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Li","key":"jönssonpedh","last":"Jönsson","name":"Jönsson, Li","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpedh","last":"Fritsch","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3643834.3661612","eisbn":["9798400705830"],"pages":"525-540","place":"Copenhagen Denmark","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85200372707"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d2a53070-4a8e-48b2-a6a0-ad8411615ff5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"How Can I Signal You To Trust Me : Investigating AI Trust Signalling in Clinical Self-Assessments","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-771128","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Research through Design is centered on making things, services and systems as a way to construct knowledge. At the same time, the act of making happens behind-the-scenes, often overlooked, outsourced or rushed through. We would like to propose a one-day workshop of making at DIS. Specifically, we propose the making of samplers as a site for constructing a shared space to contemplate the interplay of memory and imagination in design research, inspired by traditional needlework samplers as well as modern subversive stitchwork [24]. By making together, we aim to take time to consider our personal and collective commitments and stance within and outside our roles as design researchers.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Andersen, Kristina","Goveia Da Rocha, Bruna","Devendorf, Laura","Vasconcelos, Elvia","Jones, Lee","Posch, Irene","Reddy, Anuradha Venugopal","Kelliher, Aisling","Fuchsberger, Verena","Hansen, Lone Koefoed","Sandry, Etta"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-752628"],"event":{"end":"2024-07-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-07-01","title":"2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria","Canada","Netherlands","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology","Queen's University Kingston","University of Art and Industrial Design Linz","University of Colorado Boulder","University of Salzburg","University of Southern California"],"keyword":["Crafting","Critical making","Making","Research through Design"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"memoirs for the future imaginations of the past crafting samplers for intent and commitment","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3658406","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-752628","identifier":[{"id":"85198901014","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-146f9ce8-8389-4bf3-9223-3d4dead9340e"],"keyword":["Critical making","Research through design","crafting","making","samplers"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-88742C4FBB4858E49A6C11AA3B10154D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3658406","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"eindhoven university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Eindhoven University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of colorado boulder","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Colorado Boulder","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ca","key":"queen s university kingston","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Queen's University Kingston","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"at","key":"university of art and industrial design linz","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Art and Industrial Design Linz","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"university of southern california","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Southern California","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"at","key":"university of salzburg","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Salzburg","used":1},{"affno":"7","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Department of Digital Design and Information